[%-
  # ── Your library: change the values on these two lines only. ───────────────────────────────────────────
  library_name = branch.branchname;  # leave it like this to use the library name you have in Koha
  footer_note  = "";                 # one line under the signature, e.g. your opening hours; "" = none
  USE Koha;
-%]
[% IF borrower.firstname %]Dear [% borrower.firstname %],[% ELSE %]Hello,[% END %]

Welcome to [% library_name %]. Your library membership is ready to use.

* Card number: [% borrower.cardnumber %]
[% IF borrower.userid && borrower.userid != borrower.cardnumber -%]
* User name: [% borrower.userid %]
[% END -%]
[% IF borrower.dateexpiry -%]
* Member until: [% borrower.dateexpiry | $KohaDates %]
[% END -%]

[% IF Koha.Preference('OPACBaseURL') -%]
Search the catalogue and see your account online: [% Koha.Preference('OPACBaseURL') %]

[% END -%]
[% IF branch.branchphone || branch.branchemail -%]
Questions? Contact the library:
[% IF branch.branchphone -%]
  Phone [% branch.branchphone %]
[% END -%]
[% IF branch.branchemail -%]
  Email [% branch.branchemail %]
[% END -%]

[% END -%]
Thank you,
[% library_name %]
[% IF footer_note %][% footer_note %][% END %]
